lobal index":"OpenTDB_Vehicles_3296","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The majority of Subaru vehicles are made in China.\n\nOptions: \nA. True\nB. False\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{B}\n\nThe majority of Subaru vehicles are not made in China. Most Subaru vehicles are manufactured in Japan, with some production also taking place in the United States through Subaru of Indiana Automotive.","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":84,"output_tokens":40}},"cost":3.492e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Vehicles_1232","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which car tire manufacturer is famous for its \"P Zero\" line?\n\nOptions: \nA. Michelin\nB. Goodyear\nC. Pirelli\nD. Bridgestone\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The \"P Zero\" line is a high-performance tire series produced by Pirelli, widely used in sports cars and luxury vehicles. This product line is one of Pirelli's most recognized and marketed tire models. \n\n\\boxed{C}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":103,"output_tokens":51}},"cost":4.399e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Vehicles_1868","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The LS1 engine is how many cubic inches?\n\nOptions: \nA. 355\nB. 346\nC. 350\nD. 360\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The LS1 engine has a displacement of 346 cubic inches. Although it is often rounded to 5.7 liters, the exact conversion comes out to 346 cubic inches. \n\n\\boxed{B}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":104,"output_tokens":46}},"cost":4.112e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Vehicles_2389","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which car tire manufacturer is famous for its \"Eagle\" brand of tires, and is the official tire supplier of NASCAR?\n\nOptions: \nA. Michelin\nB. Goodyear\nC. Pirelli\nD. Bridgestone\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Goodyear is well known for its \"Eagle\" line of high-performance tires and has a long-standing association with NASCAR as the official tire supplier. The company has been the exclusive tire provider for NASCAR's top series for many years. \n\n\\boxed{B}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":114,"output_tokens":54}},"cost":4.722e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Vehicles_143","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Jaguar Cars was previously owned by which car manfacturer?\n\nOptions: \nA. Chrysler\nB. General Motors\nC. Fiat\nD. Ford\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_resul