 the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Terry Pratchett's Discworld novel 'Wyrd Sisters', which of these are not one of the three main witches?\n\nOptions: \nA. Nanny Ogg\nB. Magrat Garlick\nC. Winny Hathersham\nD. Granny Weatherwax\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The three main witches in Terry Pratchett's *Wyrd Sisters* are Granny Weatherwax, Nanny Ogg, and Magrat Garlick. Winny Hathersham is not a character in the Discworld series. Therefore, the correct answer is the one that is not among the core trio.\n\n\\boxed{C}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":121,"output_tokens":68}},"cost":5.6529999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_2857","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Who is the author of the series \"Malazan Book of the Fallen\"?\n\nOptions: \nA. J. R. R. Tolkien\nB. George R. R. Martin\nC. Ian Cameron Esslemont\nD. Steven Erikson\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The author of the \"Malazan Book of the Fallen\" series is Steven Erikson. While Ian Cameron Esslemont also writes in the same universe, Erikson is the primary author of the main series. \n\n\\boxed{D}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":115,"output_tokens":50}},"cost":4.495e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_2879","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the name of Eragon's dragon in \"Eragon\"?\n\nOptions: \nA. Glaedr\nB. Arya\nC. Saphira\nD. Thorn\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Eragon's dragon in the book \"Eragon\" is named Saphira. She is a blue dragon and plays a central role throughout the Inheritance Cycle. \n\n\\boxed{C}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":102,"output_tokens":40}},"cost":3.726e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_2903","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: By what name was the author Eric Blair better known?\n\nOptions: \nA. Ray Bradbury\nB. Ernest Hemingway\nC. George Orwell\nD. Aldous Huxley\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Eric Blair was the real name of the author better known by his pen name George Orwell. He is famous for writing dystopian novels such as *1984* and *Animal Farm*. \n\n\\boxed{C}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":103,"output_tokens":46}},"cost":4.099e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_2932","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is NOT a work done by Shakespeare?\n\nOptions: \nA. Trial of Temperance\nB. Cymbeline\nC. Titus Andronicus\nD. Measure For Measure\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","gene