correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The capital of Japan is Tokyo. It is the largest city in Japan and serves as the political, economic, and cultural center of the country. Tokyo has been the capital since 1868 when the Emperor moved his residence there.\n\n\\boxed{Tokyo}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":55}},"cost":4.1580000000000005e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_16","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Where can you find the Sydney Opera House?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The Sydney Opera House is a world-famous performing arts venue and UNESCO World Heritage Site situated on Bennelong Point in Sydney Harbour.  \nThe most common and accurate answer to its location is therefore Sydney, Australia (or simply Sydney).  \nNo other city or country hosts this landmark.\n\n\\boxed{Sydney, Australia}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":189,"output_tokens":62},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":6.88e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_17","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the name of the largest desert in Africa?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The largest desert in Africa is the Sahara Desert. It spans across several countries in North Africa and is the largest hot desert in the world. \n\n\\boxed{Sahara Desert}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":70,"output_tokens":38}},"cost":3.19e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_18","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which city has the largest population in the world?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The city with the largest population in the world is Tokyo, Japan. It has a metropolitan population of over 37 million people, making it the most populous urban area globally. This ranking is based on standard metropolitan area population estimates.\n\n\\boxed{Tokyo}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":69,"output_tokens":53}},"cost":4.0770000000000004e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_19","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Where is the Great Wall of China located?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The Great Wall of China is located in northern China, stretching across several provinces including Hebei, Beijing, and Gansu. It runs from the Shanhai Pass on the east coast to the Lop Lake in the west. The most common and accurate answer is China.\n\n\\boxed{China}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":68,"output_tokens":61}},"cost":4.544e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_20","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the capital of Egypt?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The capital of Egypt is Cairo. It is the largest city in Egypt and serves as the country's political, economic, and cultural center. \n\n\\boxed{Cairo}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":35}},"cost":2.9579999999999998e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_21","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which country is home to the Amazon rainforest?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The Amazon rainforest is primarily located in Brazil, which contains the largest portion of the rainforest. While several countries share parts of the Amazon, Brazil is home to the majority of it. \n\n\\boxed{Brazil}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":69,"output_tokens":45}},"cost":3.5969999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"GeoGraphyData_100k_22","prompt":"Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Where can you find the Colosseum?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The Colosseum is located in Rome, Italy. It is an ancient amphitheater situated in the center of the city and is one of the most iconic landmarks of the Roman Empire. \n\n\\boxed{Rome, Italy}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":69,"output_tokens":48}},"cost":3.777e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global inde