talgia Critic,\" where he humorously reviews nostalgic films. The other options refer to different internet personalities: James Rolfe is the Angry Video Game Nerd, AngryJoeShow is Joe Vargas, and The Cinema Snob is a character from Channel Awesome but not Doug Walker.\n\n\\boxed{B}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":106,"output_tokens":76}},"cost":5.9380000000000004e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Celebrities_2641","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: How old was Muhammad Ali when he died?\n\nOptions: \nA. He's still alive\nB. 61\nC. 74\nD. 56\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Muhammad Ali passed away on June 3, 2016, at the age of 74. He was born on January 17, 1942, which makes his age at death 74 years old. \n\n\\boxed{C}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":100,"output_tokens":58}},"cost":4.7799999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"OpenTDB_Celebrities_2874","prompt":"Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which school in Surrey, England did Steve Backshall attend?\n\nOptions: \nA. Tomlinscote School\nB. Lyndhurst School\nC. Kings International College\nD. Collingwood College\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The question asks specifically for a Surrey school attended by Steve Backshall (a TV naturalist from the Bagshot/Camberley area). Among the listed options, only Tomlinscote School matches documented